<title>ITALY: Palermo airport cargo traffic up 6.4pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>Palermo airport cargo traffic up 6.4pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palermo airport operator GESAP said total traffic handled in 1996 rose 6.4 percent from 1995. Details in tonnes were:</p>
<p>			   1996		1995	 PCT CHANGE</p>
<p> TOTAL TRAFFIC	 4,603	     4,325	up  6.4</p>
<p> INWARDS		 2,258	     2,012	up 12.2</p>
<p> OUTWARDS		2,345	     2,312	up  1.4</p>
<p>-- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+ 5017</p>
</text>
